title: >
  ASTROVITAL AI — VITALX CORE V1:
  An Edge-Deployed Clinical Decision Support System
  for Astronaut Health Monitoring in Deep Space Missions

version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-05-12
url: https://github.com/GOURGOPAL618/ASTROVITAL_AI_VITALX_CORE_V1
license: proprietary

keywords:
  - space medicine
