  - sensor correction
  - independent research

abstract: >
  ASTROVITAL AI — VITALX CORE V1 is the first working
  edge-deployed Clinical Decision Support System (CDSS)
  for astronaut health monitoring in deep space missions.
  Built on 12 peer-reviewed spaceflight research papers,
  it implements three core innovations — sensor drift
  correction, biomarker discovery, and an edge CDSS —
  achieving 85.25% accuracy with RED recall improved
  from 10.34% to 75.86%. The system operates entirely
  on-device with zero cloud dependency.

